WEBVTT

00:19:25.876 --> 00:19:30.396
Some relationships are relationships
we have because they're fun,

00:19:30.436 --> 00:19:31.596
you know?

00:19:31.596 --> 00:19:34.396
And so they're the people
I like to go out and party with.

00:19:34.436 --> 00:19:39.876
Some relationships are the relationships
that help me when I'm scared or hurting

00:19:39.876 --> 00:19:41.196
or worried about something.

00:19:41.236 --> 00:19:43.756
And I need someone
to talk things over with.

00:19:43.796 --> 00:19:46.316
I need a sounding board, a good advisor.

00:19:46.356 --> 00:19:49.476
Some relationships
are the people who, you know,

00:19:49.516 --> 00:19:53.036
loan me tools when I need to fix something
and I don't have the right tool

00:19:53.076 --> 00:19:54.956
or give me a ride to the doctor.

00:19:54.956 --> 00:19:58.596
So part of it is checking in
about, what am I missing?

00:19:59.076 --> 00:20:01.996
And then seeing what might be possible